# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`NoiseLearner` only works with the legacy server-side `Estimator`, and `NoiseLearnerV3` only works with `Executor` and the client-side `Estimator`. How a noise model is specified varies slightly based on which primitive is used.\n"
msgstr "Gumagana lang ang `NoiseLearner` kasama ang legacy na server-side na `Estimator`, at gumagana lang ang `NoiseLearnerV3` kasama ang `Executor` at ang client-side na `Estimator`. Medyo naiiba ang paraan ng pagtukoy ng noise model depende sa kung aling primitive ang ginagamit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`NoiseLearner`, when working with legacy server-side Estimator:**\n"
msgstr "**`NoiseLearner`, kapag ginagamit kasama ang legacy na server-side na Estimator:**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Reuse the same `Estimator` that produced `layers` in step 2. The noise maps returned by the\n"
"learner are positionally matched to those layers, so they must be assigned to the Estimator\n"
"they came from. PEA/PEC was already enabled on it in step 2.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin muli ang parehong `Estimator` na gumawa ng `layers` sa hakbang 2. Ang mga noise map na ibinalik ng\n"
"learner ay positionally tumutugma sa mga layer na iyon, kaya kailangan silang i-assign sa Estimator\n"
"kung saan sila nanggaling. Naka-enable na ang PEA/PEC dito sa hakbang 2.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that while `NoiseLearnerV3` supports both Pauli-Lindblad and TREX protocols, `Estimator` only accepts noise models for two-qubit layers learned with the Pauli-Lindblad protocol.\n"
msgstr "Tandaan na habang sinusuportahan ng `NoiseLearnerV3` ang parehong Pauli-Lindblad at TREX protocol, ang `Estimator` ay tumatanggap lang ng mga noise model para sa two-qubit layers na natutunan gamit ang Pauli-Lindblad protocol.\n"

